{
  "slug": "spiceai-skills",
  "name": "Spiceai Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A collection of skills for AI coding agents working with the Spice.ai runtime - data federation, acceleration, search, AI/LLM integration, and cloud management.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **15 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (15): `improve-skills` (Weekly maintenance audit that keeps every Spice skill in this repo current with what has actually shipped), `spice-acceleration` (Accelerate data locally for sub-second query performance — the feature and its configuration), `spice-accelerators` (Choose and configure the right acceleration engine — Arrow, DuckDB, SQLite, Cayenne, PostgreSQL, or Turso), `spice-ai` (Add AI and LLM capabilities to Spice — tools, NSQL (text-to-SQL), memory, model routing/workers, and evals), `spice-caching` (Configure Spice.ai in-memory result caching for SQL queries, search results, and embeddings), `spice-cloud-management` (Manage Spice.ai Cloud resources via the Management API — apps, deployments, secrets, API keys, and org members), `spice-connect-data` (Connect Spice to data sources and query across them with federated SQL — including datasets, catalogs, views, and…), `spice-data-connector` (Configure individual data source connectors in Spice — PostgreSQL, MySQL, S3, Databricks, Snowflake, DuckDB, GitHub, Kafka, and 25+…), and 7 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install spiceai-skills@claude-community` from `spiceai/skills`.",
